    "result_text": "All 264 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented optional, unique owner email on `POST /api/owners`:\n\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added an optional `email` field to the `OwnerFields` schema (string, `format: email`, max 255, not in `required`). This regenerates `OwnerFieldsDto`/`OwnerDto` with an `email` property; MapStruct auto-maps it by name.\n- **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added an `email` column + getter/setter.\n- **DB schemas** (`hsqldb`, `h2`, `mysql`, `postgres`) \u2014 added an `email` column to the `owners` table.\n- **`hsqldb/data.sql`** \u2014 the seed used positional `INSERT INTO owners VALUES (...)`, which the new column broke; switched those inserts to an explicit column list (h2/postgres already listed columns).\n- **`OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`** \u2014 added an `isDuplicateEmail` check that returns `409 Conflict` when a non-blank email is already used by another owner; a missing/blank email never conflicts and is stored and echoed back as `email`.\n\nResult: full suite green \u2014 264 tests, 0 failures, including the three new `Cp04Tests` (reject duplicate email, allow missing email, store & return email) and the existing `OwnerRestControllerV1Tests`.",
